msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Without a word, Michel approached her and the box, withdrawing a knife that "
"he had evidently kept hidden somewhere on his person."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Безмолвно Мишель подошел к ней и к коробке, извлекая нож, который он, по-"
"видимому, хранил при себе. "

#: scenario4:scenario4_02E8E371_AD8E_4D76_908F_3112A0ACA460
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b382d3230e5cfebfd8b3ac8cc8713692f5040ba658214ac275ad8b3afe321651
